# The build context is the repository root (deploy/docker/Dockerfile.node).
#
# `data/` is the running system's state — the database, its write-ahead log, the stored
# transcripts, and the backups. It is not an input to a build and shipping it to the daemon
# would be both slow and wrong.
data/
node_modules
**/node_modules
services/nlp/.venv
apps/web/dist
.git
.env.local
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.deploy.lock
